  "prefLabel": "Adm 601.04 Time",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 601.04 Time. Unless otherwise specified, all times expressed by the division of procurement and support services including but not limited to those specifications of time made in the requirements or specifications of a bid, in RFPs, in RFQs, in RFBs, or in any other purchasing requirement, shall be the time in Concord, New Hampshire.\n\nSource. # 8310, eff 5-11-05; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13; ss by #10827, eff 5-16-15; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
